    "description": "MECHANICAL PROPERTIES OF SOLIDS - CBSE 11th Class -Chemistry - Full chapter notes",
    "content": "<h2>Question 8.1</h2>\n\n<h3>\nA steel wire of length $4.7\\,\\text{m}$ and cross-sectional area\n$3.0 \\times 10^{-5}\\,\\text{m}^2$ stretches by the same amount as a copper wire\nof length $3.5\\,\\text{m}$ and cross-sectional area\n$4.0 \\times 10^{-5}\\,\\text{m}^2$ under a given load.\nWhat is the ratio of the Young's modulus of steel to that of copper?\n</h3>\n\n\n\n<h3>Solution</h3>\n\n<p>\nFor elongation of a wire,\n</p>\n\n$$\n\\Delta L=\\frac{FL}{AY}\n$$\n\n<p>\nSince both wires experience the same load and the same elongation,\n</p>\n\n$$\n\\frac{F L_s}{A_s Y_s}=\\frac{F L_c}{A_c Y_c}\n$$\n\n<p>\nCancelling the common load \\(F\\),\n</p>\n\n$$\n\\frac{L_s}{A_sY_s}=\\frac{L_c}{A_cY_c}\n$$\n\n<p>\nRearranging,\n</p>\n\n$$\n\\frac{Y_s}{Y_c}=\\frac{L_sA_c}{L_cA_s}\n$$\n\n<p>\nSubstitute the given values:\n</p>\n\n$$\n\\frac{Y_s}{Y_c}\n=\n\\frac{4.7\\times4.0\\times10^{-5}}\n{3.5\\times3.0\\times10^{-5}}\n$$\n\n$$\n=\n\\frac{18.8}{10.5}\n$$\n\n$$\n=1.79\n$$\n\n<p>\n<strong>Answer:</strong>\n</p>\n\n$$\n\\boxed{\\frac{Y_{\\text{steel}}}{Y_{\\text{copper}}}\\approx1.79}\n$$\n\n<hr>\n\n<h2>Question 8.2</h2>\n\n<h3>\nFigure 8.9 shows the stress–strain curve for a given material.\nFind:\n</h3>\n\n<svg width=\"500\" height=\"420\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 420\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n  <!-- Background -->\n  <rect width=\"500\" height=\"420\" fill=\"white\"/>\n\n  <!-- Plot Area -->\n  <rect x=\"70\" y=\"30\" width=\"300\" height=\"250\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n\n  <!-- Horizontal Grid -->\n  <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"280\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"238\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"238\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"196\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"154\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"112\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"70\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"30\"/>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- Vertical Grid -->\n  <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"280\"/>\n    <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"280\"/>\n    <line x1=\"190\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"280\"/>\n    <line x1=\"250\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"280\"/>\n    <line x1=\"310\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"280\"/>\n    <line x1=\"370\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"280\"/>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- Axes -->\n  <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n\n  <!-- Stress-Strain Curve -->\n  <path d=\"\n      M70 280\n      L120 230\n      L170 180\n      L220 140\n      L270 100\n      L320 55\n      C335 45 345 40 355 40\n      C365 40 372 45 378 50\"\n      fill=\"none\"\n      stroke=\"#0096d6\"\n      stroke-width=\"3\"\n      stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n      stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n\n  <!-- Y-axis Labels -->\n  <g font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"Arial\" text-anchor=\"end\">\n    <text x=\"62\" y=\"284\">0</text>\n    <text x=\"62\" y=\"242\">50</text>\n    <text x=\"62\" y=\"200\">100</text>\n    <text x=\"62\" y=\"158\">150</text>\n    <text x=\"62\" y=\"116\">200</text>\n    <text x=\"62\" y=\"74\">250</text>\n    <text x=\"62\" y=\"34\">300</text>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- X-axis Labels -->\n  <g font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"Arial\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <text x=\"70\" y=\"300\">0</text>\n    <text x=\"130\" y=\"300\">0.001</text>\n    <text x=\"190\" y=\"300\">0.002</text>\n    <text x=\"250\" y=\"300\">0.003</text>\n    <text x=\"310\" y=\"300\">0.004</text>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- Axis Titles -->\n  <text x=\"220\" y=\"340\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"Arial\">\n    Strain\n  </text>\n\n  <text transform=\"rotate(-90 18 155)\"\n        x=\"18\"\n        y=\"155\"\n        font-size=\"16\"\n        font-family=\"Arial\">\n    Stress (10⁶ N/m²)\n  </text>\n\n  <!-- Figure Caption -->\n  <text x=\"220\" y=\"390\"\n        text-anchor=\"middle\"\n        font-size=\"16\"\n        font-family=\"Arial\"\n        font-style=\"italic\"\n        fill=\"#0070c0\">\n    Fig. 8.9\n  </text>\n\n</svg>\n\n<h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Young's modulus of the material.</li>\n<li>Approximate yield strength of the material.</li>\n</ol>\n</h3>\n\n<h3>Solution</h3>\n\n<h4>(a) Young's Modulus</h4>\n\n<p>\nYoung's modulus is the slope of the straight-line portion of the stress–strain curve.\nChoose a point from the graph:\n</p>\n\n$$\n\\text{Stress}=300\\times10^{6}\\,\\text{N/m}^2,\n\\qquad\n\\text{Strain}=0.004\n$$\n\n<p>\nTherefore,\n</p>\n\n$$\nY=\\frac{\\text{Stress}}{\\text{Strain}}\n$$\n\n$$\nY=\\frac{300\\times10^{6}}{0.004}\n$$\n\n$$\nY=7.5\\times10^{10}\\,\\text{N/m}^2\n$$\n\n<p>\nHence,\n</p>\n\n$$\n\\boxed{Y\\approx7.5\\times10^{10}\\,\\text{N/m}^2}\n$$\n\n<h4>(b) Yield Strength</h4>\n\n<svg width=\"500\" height=\"420\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 420\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n  <!-- Background -->\n  <rect width=\"500\" height=\"420\" fill=\"white\"/>\n\n  <!-- Plot Area -->\n  <rect x=\"70\" y=\"30\" width=\"300\" height=\"250\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n\n  <!-- Horizontal Grid -->\n  <g stroke=\"#bdbdbd\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"280\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"238\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"238\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"196\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"154\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"112\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"70\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"30\"/>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- Vertical Grid -->\n  <g stroke=\"#bdbdbd\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"280\"/>\n    <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"280\"/>\n    <line x1=\"190\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"280\"/>\n    <line x1=\"250\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"280\"/>\n    <line x1=\"310\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"280\"/>\n    <line x1=\"370\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"280\"/>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- Axes -->\n  <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n\n  <!-- Stress-Strain Curve -->\n  <path\n      d=\"M70 280\n         L120 230\n         L170 180\n         L220 140\n         L270 100\n         L320 55\n         C335 42 350 38 360 42\n         C370 45 375 50 378 55\"\n      fill=\"none\"\n      stroke=\"#00a2e8\"\n      stroke-width=\"4\"\n      stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n      stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n\n  <!-- Yield Point -->\n  <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"55\" r=\"6\" fill=\"red\"/>\n\n  <!-- Dashed Guide Lines -->\n  <line x1=\"320\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"280\"\n        stroke=\"red\"\n        stroke-width=\"1.5\"\n        stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"/>\n\n  <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"55\"\n        stroke=\"red\"\n        stroke-width=\"1.5\"\n        stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"/>\n\n  <!-- Arrow -->\n  <defs>\n    <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\"\n            refX=\"8\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n      <path d=\"M0,0 L8,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"red\"/>\n    </marker>\n  </defs>\n\n  <line x1=\"430\" y1=\"35\"\n        x2=\"326\" y2=\"55\"\n        stroke=\"red\"\n        stroke-width=\"2\"\n        marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n\n  <!-- Label -->\n  <text x=\"385\"\n        y=\"35\"\n        font-size=\"15\"\n        font-family=\"Arial\"\n        fill=\"red\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\">\n      Yield Point\n  </text>\n\n  <!-- Y-axis Labels -->\n  <g font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"Arial\" text-anchor=\"end\">\n    <text x=\"62\" y=\"284\">0</text>\n    <text x=\"62\" y=\"242\">50</text>\n    <text x=\"62\" y=\"200\">100</text>\n    <text x=\"62\" y=\"158\">150</text>\n    <text x=\"62\" y=\"116\">200</text>\n    <text x=\"62\" y=\"74\">250</text>\n    <text x=\"62\" y=\"34\">300</text>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- X-axis Labels -->\n  <g font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"Arial\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <text x=\"70\" y=\"300\">0</text>\n    <text x=\"130\" y=\"300\">0.001</text>\n    <text x=\"190\" y=\"300\">0.002</text>\n    <text x=\"250\" y=\"300\">0.003</text>\n    <text x=\"310\" y=\"300\">0.004</text>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- Axis Titles -->\n  <text x=\"220\" y=\"340\"\n        font-size=\"16\"\n        font-family=\"Arial\">\n      Strain\n  </text>\n\n  <text transform=\"rotate(-90 18 155)\"\n        x=\"18\"\n        y=\"155\"\n        font-size=\"16\"\n        font-family=\"Arial\">\n      Stress (10⁶ N/m²)\n  </text>\n\n  <!-- Figure Caption -->\n  <text x=\"220\"\n        y=\"390\"\n        text-anchor=\"middle\"\n        font-size=\"16\"\n        font-family=\"Arial\"\n        fill=\"#0070c0\"\n        font-style=\"italic\">\n      Fig. 8.9\n  </text>\n\n</svg>\n\n<p>\nThe yield strength is the stress at which the graph begins to deviate from the straight line.\nFrom the graph, this occurs at approximately\n</p>\n\n$$\n300\\times10^{6}\\,\\text{N/m}^2\n$$\n\n<p>\nTherefore,\n</p>\n\n$$\n\\boxed{\\text{Yield Strength}\\approx3.0\\times10^{8}\\,\\text{N/m}^2}\n$$\n\n<h3>Final Answers</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>$$\\boxed{E\\approx7.5\\times10^{10}\\,\\text{N/m}^2}$$</li>\n<li>$$\\boxed{\\text{Yield Strength}\\approx3.0\\times10^{8}\\,\\text{N/m}^2}$$</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n",
